    {
      "name": "Programmed to Serve",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor13It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Every Cyber-Construct has a pre-programed task to perform. They will continue to operate on their programmed functions until re-programmed with a Hard (−20) Tech (Augmetics) Test. The individual that programmed (or re-programmed) the Cyber-Construct can give it simple orders.  Magnetic Jaw: The Cyber-Mastiff may magnetically attach itself to any metal surface and lock its jaws around an opponent. If the Bullpup successfully hits with a bite attack, it may lock itself in position instead of dealing damage. Freeing oneself from a Bullpup's magnetic jaws require a Hard (-20) Strength test. If ordered to, the Bullpup may activate its chainbite, dealing damage to the target before releasing.</p>"
        },
